 \B Space Harrier\W core by \Rniknak\W
 built on \RJTFRAME\W by \RJotego\W
  http://patreon.com/jotego

PCB supplied by \Rniknak\W

Sega Hang-On hardware:
dual 68000 + Z80 + YM2203
+ SegaPCM and an i8751 MCU.

Developed against an original
cabinet and known good PCBs.

Options in the DIP menu:
-Stick Direction
   Arcade is the cabinet's
   aircraft stick: push up
   and Harrier goes down
-D-Pad Control
   Arcade springs back to
   centre, Console holds
-V Glyph Fix
   the letter V is drawn
   wrong in the original ROM


Space Harrier is an analog
game. The stick is the
intended control.

Service mode: F2 or Test
